::: {.cell-output-display}
![](11-regression-slides_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){fig-align='center' width=9in}
:::
:::


::: {.fragment}
$b$ is the slope: $\dfrac{\text{rise}}{\text{run}}$, the change in $Y$ for a one unit change in $X$
